This repository is a submission to the Rajasthan Innovation Challenge.
Intellectual property terms for the submission follow the challenge's
IIC guidelines; no separate open-source license is granted for the
application code (`index.html`, `css/`, `js/`) beyond evaluating this
submission, pending those terms.

Two parts of this repository are licensed independently of the above:

1. Fonts (`assets/fonts/`) — Noto Sans Devanagari and Inter, both under
   the SIL Open Font License 1.1. See `assets/fonts/OFL-*.txt`.

2. The Rajasthani lexicon (`data/lexicon.json`) — offered as an open
   contribution to DoIT&C regardless of the challenge outcome, per the
   note in that file.

See `README.md` § Licence for the same statement in context.
